nd\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the weekly percentage of infections attributed to the Alpha variant increased steadily from 20% to approximately 67%\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Differences between groups were calculated using chi-square tests; statistical significance was defined as p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Cox proportional hazards regression analysis was used to obtain the adjusted hazard ratio (aHR) and corresponding 95% confidence interval (CI)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Regression models were stratified by vaccination status, and were adjusted for age, sex, race/ethnicity, presence of underlying medical conditions, and study period.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}